Why this license? (not legal advice)

We follow the open-core model used by Supabase, n8n, Reown, and others:
- The framework, integrations, portal, and SDKs are source-available
- The simulation engine core remains proprietary
- Community builders get full access to build on top of Codna
- Commercial deployment beyond the thresholds requires a paid license

